    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You suddenly become less accomplished at math as your foe cuts half your hand off. If you still have both feet you can count to ten on your toes instead.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Stunned] (2) and @Condition[Bleeding] (1). You also lose 1d10/2 fingers – @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.SYjWiKDzMS6CtROJ]{Amputation (Challenging)}. If five fingers are lost you lose the entire hand.</p>"
